# Math

Inline formulas sit in the text: the energy $E=mc^2$, a sum $\sum_{k=1}^{n} k = \frac{n(n+1)}{2}$ and a tall one $\left(\frac{a}{b}\right)^2$ that raises its line.

## Energy $E=mc^2$ in a heading

$$
\int_0^1 x^2\,dx = \frac{1}{3}
$$

The $$H_2$$ and $$O_2$$ gas sit on their own centred lines, and the sentence goes on after them.

A wide formula scrolls sideways in its own box:

$$
f(x) = a_0 + a_1 x + a_2 x^2 + a_3 x^3 + a_4 x^4 + a_5 x^5 + a_6 x^6 + a_7 x^7 + a_8 x^8 + a_9 x^9 + a_{10} x^{10} + a_{11} x^{11}
$$

Errors show their source, muted: $\frac{1}{$ and $\foo$ and $x^$.

Colour commands draw in the text colour: $\color{red} x + \textcolor{blue}{y}$ and $\colorbox{yellow}{boxed}$.

Chemistry loads on demand: $\ce{2H2O -> 2H2 + O2}$.

Money stays text: it costs $5 and $10, raise $5M at $25M post, $5M-$10M, and I can pay 20$ after $500.

\[
\sqrt{310^2-250.5^2}=182.6\text{ mm}
\]

- A list item with a formula $\alpha + \beta$
- A display block in an item:

  $$
  \nabla \cdot \mathbf{E} = \frac{\rho}{\varepsilon_0}
  $$

> [!note] A callout with math
> The Gaussian $e^{-x^2}$ integrates to $\sqrt{\pi}$.
> $$
> \int_{-\infty}^{\infty} e^{-x^2}\,dx = \sqrt{\pi}
> $$

